/*
 * OAuth Callback URL Format:
 *   If APPLICATION_URL = 'http://tasks.verslib.re'
 *   Then Google OAuth redirect URI = 'http://tasks.verslib.re/oauth/google/callback'
 *
 * Common Issues:
 *   1. redirect_uri_mismatch - APPLICATION_URL doesn't match Google OAuth settings
 *   2. Make sure APPLICATION_URL has no trailing slash
 *   3. Protocol must match exactly (http vs https)
 *   4. After changes, restart container: docker restart kanboard
 *
 * Testing OAuth:
 *   curl -I http://your-domain/oauth/google
 *   Should see 302 redirect to accounts.google.com
 *
 * Documentation:
 *   - Kanboard: https://docs.kanboard.org/
 *   - Google OAuth: https://console.cloud.google.com/
 */
